1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,157
In REAPER, open Actions > Show Action
List, then click "Load ReaScript...".

2
00:00:07,357 --> 00:00:12,157
Open the MIDI-GPT folder inside
REAPER's Scripts folder.

3
00:00:12,357 --> 00:00:18,086
Choose "MIDI-GPT.py". That's the
dashboard, the only script you need.

4
00:00:18,286 --> 00:00:23,157
The other scripts are helpers
the dashboard runs for you.

5
00:00:23,357 --> 00:00:26,443
Run it, and the dashboard opens.

6
00:00:28,643 --> 00:00:34,657
Tip: give it a shortcut. Select it in
the Action List and click "Add...".

7
00:00:36,857 --> 00:00:43,514
Or add it to a toolbar: right-click the
toolbar and choose "Customize toolbar...".

8
00:00:46,714 --> 00:00:50,086
Now the dashboard is one click away.
